{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901019100010","name":"摩美々","text":"──これ、開けてもいいですかぁ？","trans":"——这个，可以打开吗～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、もちろん","trans":"嗯，当然","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019100020","name":"摩美々","text":"──タオル……\r\nちょうど新しいの買おうかなって思ってましたぁ","trans":"——毛巾……\n我正好想着要不要买条新的呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おお……！\r\nそれはちょうどよかった！","trans":"哦哦……！\n那真是太巧了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019100030","name":"摩美々","text":"……なんか、\r\nわかりすぎてるって感じで怖いですねー","trans":"……怎么说呢，\n就是那种太懂我了的感觉，有点吓人呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"えっ、怖い……！？","trans":"诶，吓人……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019100040","name":"摩美々","text":"ふふー、なんてー","trans":"呵呵～，逗你的～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901019100050","name":"摩美々","text":"……これ、大事にしますねー","trans":"……这个，我会好好珍惜的～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}